  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Turns the OWASP API Security Top 10 2023 (API1:2023 to API10:2023, stable release June 2023) into a review workflow for HTTP, GraphQL and RPC APIs. The 2023 edition is current and the 2019 edition is legacy; no newer edition or release candidate exists, so there is no preview. SKILL.md holds the authorization, authentication, resource-limit, outbound-request and inventory invariants and the review workflow; references cover the version lines with the full 2019 to 2023 mapping, each risk with its rating, vulnerability test, scenarios and prevention, and a checklist that maps HTTP, GraphQL and RPC onto the Top 10's terms.",
